{"4237900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Point Zero: Victoria", "steam_appid": 4237900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237900/extras/e12a8c4dbe6d1e281057cadbe719da54.avif?t=1782616983\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“There are no facts, only interpretations.” — Friedrich Nietzsche</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must piece together fragments of memory from the “deathbed flashbacks” of the four main characters, with every shift in perspective overturning what you thought you knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you’re on the “ceiling level”? But maybe you’re actually on someone else’s “floor level”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game centers on its story, but also features elements of exploration, deduction, criminal investigation, puzzle-solving, and combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready for a spine-tingling experience filled with layer upon layer of twists!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a solo indie project. Thank you so much for playing and adding it to your wishlist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237900/extras/e12a8c4dbe6d1e281057cadbe719da54.avif?t=1782616983\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“There are no facts, only interpretations.” — Friedrich Nietzsche</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must piece together fragments of memory from the “deathbed flashbacks” of the four main characters, with every shift in perspective overturning what you thought you knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you’re on the “ceiling level”? But maybe you’re actually on someone else’s “floor level”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game centers on its story, but also features elements of exploration, deduction, criminal investigation, puzzle-solving, and combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready for a spine-tingling experience filled with layer upon layer of twists!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a solo indie project. Thank you so much for playing and adding it to your wishlist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "One cold case, four deathbed flashbacks. Every shift in perspective overturns the &quot;truth&quot; you believed. Story-driven, with exploration, deduction, puzzles, and combat. Ready for a mind-bending thrill ride with twists at every turn?", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237900/654d7cb93fa98407a678cb3ff96f72824db19c7b/header.jpg?t=1782616983", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237900/14f34a6f18b6eb24c7371296feedaf5da226ef82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782616983", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237900/14f34a6f18b6eb24c7371296feedaf5da226ef82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782616983", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7 or Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4460 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX1060 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<b